      "other_list": {
        "0": {
          "$deleted": true,
          "details": "<p>Each player roll a<strong> DC13 【WLP】+【WLP】</strong>Check, on a failure, they are inflicts with <img src=\"https://assets.forge-vtt.com/610d918102e7ac281373ffcb/Skill%20Icon/FFXIVIcons%20Battle(PvE)/BLU/condensed_libra.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"21\" height=\"21\">@UUID[JournalEntry.mINm5XmNcnbSzgrN]{Despair}</p>",
          "icon": "",
          "other_name": "False Hope",
          "roll": ""
        },
        "1": {
          "$deleted": false,
          "details": "<p>Recovers 💧<strong>150 MP</strong></p>",
          "icon": "",
          "other_name": "Mana Charge",
          "roll": ""
        },
        "2": {
          "$deleted": false,
          "details": "<blockquote>\n<p>Veela is gathering immense magical energy</p>\n</blockquote>\n<section class=\"secret\">\n<p>Combo into: Glacies Finis</p>\n</section>",
          "icon": "",
          "other_name": "💬Focus",
          "roll": ""
        },
        "3": {
          "$deleted": false,
          "details": "<blockquote>\n<p>Veela is manipulating the ice around her, shaping it into a massive shard of glacier.</p>\n</blockquote>\n<p>During this period, Veela gain <img src=\"https://assets.forge-vtt.com/610d918102e7ac281373ffcb/Skill%20Icon/FFXIVIcons%20Battle(PvE)/14_SMN/summon_phoenix.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"17\" height=\"17\"> <strong>Flying</strong></p>\n<section class=\"secret\">\n<p>Combo into: Icicle Lance</p>\n</section>",
          "icon": "",
          "other_name": "💬Gathering Frost",
          "roll": ""
        },
        "4": {
          "$deleted": false,
          "details": "<ul>\n<li><strong><img src=\"https://assets.forge-vtt.com/610d918102e7ac281373ffcb/Skill%20Icon/FFXIVIcons%20Battle(PvE)/02_WAR/inner_release.png\" width=\"21\" height=\"21\"><a class=\"content-link\" draggable=\"true\" data-uuid=\"JournalEntry.UqXGUQM31kWc7BTc\" data-id=\"UqXGUQM31kWc7BTc\" data-type=\"JournalEntry\" data-tooltip=\"Journal Entry\">Unleash</a></strong></li>\n</ul>\n<p>Discard all previous bonds</p>\n<p>Gain a new Bond with \"Eye of Tragedy\" and put 3 points into it</p>",
          "icon": "",
          "other_name": "Cursed Blizzard",
          "roll": ""
        },
        "5": {
          "$deleted": false,
          "details": "<blockquote>\n<p>You sense the encroaching darkness, as a feeling of loneliness begins to seep into your heart...</p>\n</blockquote>\n<p>Isolate the party by trapping them in darkness. Preventing them from<strong>&nbsp;Invoking their Bonds</strong> with others.</p>\n<p>Additionally, preventing the party member from being able to <strong>target</strong> each other or <strong>received any effects</strong> from other party members.</p>\n<section class=\"secret\">\n<p>Stop the Battle Music. Encourage the Player to roleplay or initiate their Flashback, making them think of painful memories.</p>\n</section>",
          "icon": "",
          "other_name": "Severe Bond",
          "roll": ""
        }
      },
