      "special_list": {
        "0": {
          "$deleted": false,
          "details": "<p>Veela gain<strong> </strong>50% of all missing bonds as<strong> Zero Power</strong> at the end of each round.</p>",
          "icon": "",
          "roll": "",
          "special_name": "⚔️Despair"
        },
        "1": {
          "$deleted": false,
          "details": "<p>Any players may use their <strong>Objective</strong> action to reminds Veela of the bonds she share with her past.</p>\n<p>This will allows Veela to <strong>bond</strong> with the subject that was talk about.</p>\n<section class=\"secret\">\n<p>As Veela gains more bond, she will received the following debuffs:</p>\n<ol>\n<li>Becomes <strong>Dazed</strong></li>\n<li>Becomes <strong>Shaken</strong></li>\n<li>Becomes <strong>Slow</strong></li>\n<li>Becomes <strong>Weak</strong></li>\n<li>Gain Vulnerability to<strong> Light</strong> Damage</li>\n<li>Gain Vulnerability to <strong>Fire</strong> Damage</li>\n</ol>\n</section>",
          "icon": "",
          "roll": "",
          "special_name": "Fickle Hope"
        },
